     ("Under SaaS, what does the customer still manage?", "Identities, access and the data itself", "Nothing", "The operating system", "The application code"),
     ("Data classification and access control are the customer's responsibility:", "Under every service model, including SaaS", "Only on premises", "Only under IaaS", "Only under PaaS"),
     ("A system needing a specific unsupported OS kernel module argues for:", "On-premises or IaaS, where the customer controls the OS", "SaaS", "PaaS", "Any model"),
